// The last step of the argfn chain (msg/narrowmsg.id's argfn_c, and narrow.id
// and args.id before it): "g" registered by index, with a declared return type,
// so a case can ask about a call to a function the registry really knows.
// Filed here rather than beside argfn_c because msg/ is full.
argfn_d() {
  argfn_c();
  fidx_add("g");
  push((import frets), "int");
} return void;
():() then calls fidx_add:("g")
():() then (import frets)[0]:("int")
():() then (import chkfail)[0]:(0)
():() then init_units:(0)
